# Keep essential user-facing documentation:
# - README.md (project overview) ✓
# - ARCHITECTURE.md (architecture details) ✓
# - CONTRIBUTING.md (contribution guidelines) ✓
# - CI_CD_SETUP_GUIDE.md (comprehensive CI/CD guide) ✓
# - reconcile-agent/SETUP_GUIDE.md (app setup) ✓
# - reconcile-agent/QUICKSTART.md (app quick start) ✓
# - reconcile-agent/ADVERSARIAL_TEST_PRD.md (test documentation) ✓
# - reconcile-agent/security_best_practices_report.md (security docs) ✓
# - .github/workflows/README.md (workflow docs) ✓
# - All files in references/ directories ✓
